{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/FINA-Steam_title_banner-aboutEN.png?t=1746082426\" />Final Stardust is a return to basics for Collectible Card Games! It's built around fast-paced, five minute battles thanks to streamlined, easily understandable gameplay. Thanks to instant effects and positioning your monsters - or Planos - it's all about how you play the hand you draw, rather than mastery of meta and min-maxing your deck.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/FINA-Steam_title_banner-learnEN.png?t=1746082426\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/for_gif_3.gif?t=1746082426\" />No overcomplicated effects. No special rules. Just you and your opponent, a stack of cards with easily understandable effects, and an endless variety of tactics to use. What matters is your choice here and now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/FINA-steam-description_header-win-EN.png?t=1746082426\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/for_gif_1.gif?t=1746082426\" />Mechanics are balanced to ensure fast paced matches that aren't decided in the first ten seconds by luck of the draw. You can always make a comeback with the next hand if you play the cards right, even if you're up against the wall. Worried about stalling? A set turn limit ensures each game wraps up quick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/FINA-steam-description_header-losing-EN.png?t=1746082426\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/for_gif_2.gif?t=1746082426\" />You don't lose a battle to random chance or the opponent having a one-in-a-million combination of exotic effects. It's all about your choices in each match, making every win and every loss understandable. Once you understand the core mechanics with a few quick matches, it's all down to skill! Even when you\u2019re losing, there\u2019s always an opportunity to strike back and win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/for_gif_4.gif?t=1746082426\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"ELEMENTALIST","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/8da4c6a85e6901ab8ecd02455e846d1acf7d71c4.jpg"},{"name":"BEGINNER'S LUCK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/5b1b8651a836d34814bfad73ea7f6585682d60df.jpg"},{"name":"PLANO SUMMONER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/8167a950a2871c7b74be056f5411e1f2dc4416f5.jpg"},{"name":"VETERAN VICTORIES","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/4402d8649730f3a3bb4d3b0141daa53b9fae8ba8.jpg"},{"name":"WEALTH ACCUMULATOR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/14aaed41b4fa6bcd2826ea055bf9c11a4bec6c89.jpg"},{"name":"BLUE GATHERER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/5085c3984d85c30ae31bb9e63bf82cef9e3832bd.jpg"},{"name":"LEVEL ACHIEVER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/26e6787e43542d52c4400f4fcb05dcd053ae82c3.jpg"},{"name":"SEASONED PLAYER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea